475

-CASE BarabasiAlbertErrorP3
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL generate_barabasi_albert(n:=4, k:=5, seed:=1) RETURN node1
---- error
Binder exception: generate_barabasi_albert requires k < n (k is the number of edges attached per new node).
